Now check the actual license status

Because ospp.vbs isn't in the old Office16 location, run:

dir "C:\Program Files\Microsoft Office" /s /b | findstr /i "ospp.vbs"

If it finds a path, run the exact path it gives you with:

cscript "PATH_SHOWN_BY_COMMAND" /dstatus

That will tell us the last 5 characters of the installed key and activation status.

Important: Don't post any full product key if it appears. Only the last 5 characters are needed.